sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant API as API Auth Controller/Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant SMTP as SMTP
  participant RP as Reset Page

  U->>FE: fill email + submit
  FE->>API: POST /auth/forgot-password {email}
  API->>DB: find user by email
  alt user exists
    API->>DB: invalidate previous active tokens
    API->>DB: create password_reset_token(hash, expiresAt)
    API->>SMTP: send reset link
    SMTP-->>U: email with reset link + expiry info
    API-->>FE: 200 generic message
  else user does not exist
    API-->>FE: 200 generic message
  else smtp fails
    API-->>FE: 503 temporary failure
  end

  U->>U: open email and click link
  U->>RP: open link with token
  U->>FE: fill new password + confirm
  FE->>API: POST /auth/reset-password {token,password,confirmPassword}
  API->>DB: validate token(hash, expiration, used)

  alt token valid and passwords match
    API->>DB: update user password hash
    API->>DB: mark token usedAt
    API-->>FE: 200 Password reset successfully
    FE-->>U: success feedback + redirect login
  else token expired/used/invalid
    API-->>FE: 400 invalid or expired token
    FE-->>U: show token error
  else password mismatch
    API-->>FE: 400 password/confirm mismatch
    FE-->>U: show validation error
  end
